      "Return to Anne at the mess-hall counter and repeat the conversation."
    ],
    "beegle-room": [
      "Check cabin storage before leaving the ship.",
      "Inspect the cupboards and cabinets in the inspector's room."
    ],
    "recruit-drirr": [
      "Follow the city's investigation before worrying about party recruitment.",
      "Complete the festival investigation sequence in Jirinaar."
    ],
    "recruit-sira": [
      "An unresolved confrontation holds up your next ally.",
      "Finish the confrontation in the city's guild."
    ],
    "rejira-exploit": [
      "An optional conversation can help stretch your early supplies.",
      "Revisit Rejira's conversation and consider selling surplus healing supplies."
    ],
    "formers-stats": [
      "Look carefully for unusual vegetation and concealed passages.",
      "Search the rainbow bushes and cracked walls in the Former’s Building."
    ],
    "train-cheap": [
      "Before leaving the first island, compare training costs.",
      "Jirinaar is the guide's recommended early training stop."
    ],
    "recruit-melthas": [
      "Continue the druid route to meet a potential ally.",
      "Explore the druid hut around Arjano."
    ],
    "monster-eye": [
      "Browse the island's mixed-goods shop for a useful utility item.",
      "Visit Rifrako in Aballon."
    ],
    "dreamshield": [
      "A village merchant offers a particularly useful shield.",
      "Check Rifrako's stock in Aballon."
    ],
    "bandits": [
      "The mountain route offers an optional source of loot.",
      "Sell mountain-pass spoils in Vanello."
    ],
    "choose-siobhan-or-khunag": [
      "Consider which companion fits your route before committing to a choice.",
      "Beloveno offers a choice between a fighter and a mage."
    ],
    "assassination-sequence": [
      "Follow up the council's leads promptly and revisit your contact after gathering information.",
      "Keep track of the council, information broker, and friend's conversations."
    ],
    "herras-key": [
      "After helping someone, return and ask about a reward.",
      "Return to Herras after resolving the threat."
    ],
    "harriet": [
      "Speak to the people at the island's headquarters about the next stage.",
      "A new companion at the headquarters changes your party."
    ],
    "flowers": [
      "Explore the island's outlying paths for unusual plants.",
      "Check paths near bridges, water, and trees for permanent stat improvements."
    ],
    "umajo-sell": [
      "Consider holding valuable loot until you can compare city merchants.",
      "Umajo is the guide's recommended place to sell valuable loot."
    ],
    "porenoil": [
      "Prepare for the desert before traveling far from the city.",
      "Ask at the Equipment Maker's Guild about desert protection."
    ],
    "find-path": [
      "You have a choice: hire a guide or follow the terrain yourself.",
      "Ohl can guide you for a Jewel; an independent coastline route is also described."
    ],
    "codes": [
      "Read the ship's notes carefully and consider whether an entry must be interpreted differently.",
      "Consult the notebook, service-level notes, and reversed code notes."
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Record what you discover, then return to the people waiting for your report.",
